  "summary": "I look for challenges and opportunities to grow both my technical and soft skills. I want to work on products I would use to solve the problems my customers have.\n\nI have experience shipping numerous releases for both on premise, and cloud offerings. I've worked across a diverse set of software stacks from open source projects, to cloud services in a diverse set of roles including test, development, architecture, and infrastructure.\n\nTechnically I pride myself on writing and designing maintainable, testable, debugable, and secure software. I strive to deliver incremental solutions that provide customers value and allow us to validate our product with customers without missing opportunities in the market. \n\nI deeply understand the practical realities of building software. I know the best technical solution is not always the best business solution and vis versa. I can soberly articulate technical and business tradeoffs for a project to stakeholders across disciplines and drive consensus. ",
