      "description": "Worked on the Office Collaboration Service, the backend service for multi-person co-authoring in word, excel, and power point, driving extensibility, security and reliability efforts across the product.\n\nWorked in the Office Experience Organization driving modern service engineering in numerous products with a specific focus on increasing development and operational agility. Moved numerous services from monolithic code bases into Visual Studio Online git repos. Enabled continous build, validation and deployment. \n\nWorked on HDInsight, Microsoft's managed Hadoop service in Azure. I was a technical lead for HDInsight applications, the worlds first one click third party application install experience on Hadoop. I worked directly with numerous partners to gather requirements and onboard their applications. I drove the API and service design for the project, and mentored a number of junior developers through the implementation.",
